{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793270/extras/1Promo_01_N_a.jpg?t=1749714825\" /><strong>Bygoner</strong> is a story-driven action-adventure that follows a nameless wanderer haunted by his past and pursued by Death itself. Set in a world where memory is a burden and the road forward is the only escape, you must navigate a war-torn land of fading empires, ancient rites, and unforgiven sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you fight, trade, or deceive your way through ruined villages, military outposts, and forgotten shrines, your past slowly unfolds\u2014and so does the cost of your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by Slavic folklore and historical tragedy, <i>Bygoner</i> blends narrative exploration, moral ambiguity, and immersive third-person gameplay. Will you find redemption? Or are you already too far gone?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793270?t=1749714825","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793270/34f897aad44c59f49ea46ab3739a990c350cfee0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749714825","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793270/8ce5282a9409db135170cedcc9b31868d46097e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749714825","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793270/8ce5282a9409db135170cedcc9b31868d46097e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749714825","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793270/extras/1Pro